    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56727" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερᾰός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρας</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>horned</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.85
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
