					1.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄμμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					835
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Berytus</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>made of horn</i>, 
